# 1v1, the shadow fix (BENCH-243, MOVE-43), a global change Leigh approved on 13 Nov. Today one of our bullets that
# hits, misses or meets a bullet takes with it every shadow it cast on enemy waves, the turns before it died included,
# though an enemy bullet fired into those turns' shadow would already have died on it. With MOVE-43 the bullet keeps
# them. DrussGT made this fix in 3.1.18 (+0.30 over 3.1.16 with its other changes, spread thin over the field).
#   field   1,194 robots (census-312 less the 1.11.2 skips)   c / aa / kp   2 seeds from 19300
# Leigh starts it once the PC is free (one card at a time, from master):
#   git checkout master && git pull
#   .\queue.ps1 run pc-shadow        (or  ./queue.sh run pc-shadow)
# One bench queue, RoboRumble workers at 0, unpinned, 16 workers, truth log off. Every step resumes; no step needs a
# decision. About 7,200 battles, 2 to 3 hours.
#
# Why it should win (the PC card rule of 2026-11-03):
#   - It fixes a fault, not a guess: the shadows the surf scores after a bullet dies are exactly the ones the engine
#     would have honoured.
#   - The cloud forensic (48 learning guns, truth logs, docs/bench/local/2026-11-13_dm-aes.md) read the same real-hit
#     share as master (-0.0016 +- 0.0051) and the danger ranking the hit option top a little more often (0.449 against
#     0.442), score +0.67 +- 1.53 points; one seed cannot see a field-wide gain this size, so the PC reads it on the
#     whole field.
#   - Gate: kp's census-weighted field gain, A/A inside its band; ship on the 95% low end above 0.
# Pilot and stop rules (docs/bench/watch.md): the aa arm halts the card after 20% if master and its copy disagree;
# halt on 30 failed battles, an arm scoring nothing in 8, 80+ skipped turns a battle over the last 200 (60 on the
# panels; the whole field runs master near 56-60, issue #808), or no battle in 30 minutes. ALERT opens an issue
# for Leigh on any stop.
# Bank: the owning cloud thread turns MOVE-43 on (or removes it) on this card's results PR. Nothing is released.

set V = 3.22
set P = --parallel 16 --no-truth-log --failed-ok
set C = --skip-build --skip-fetch --rounds 35 --cpu-constant 1488498 --child-heap 2G
set W = work/pc-shadow
set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set ALERT = lgriffin

prep | git checkout -q master && mkdir -p bisect work && (cd .. && mvn -q -DskipTests package) && cp ../hadur-robot/target/hadur117.Hadur_${V}.jar bisect/ && bash ./build-ablation.sh aa && bash ./build-ablation.sh shkeep && test -f bisect/hadur117.Hadur_${V}kp.jar && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set panel-shadow.txt && mvn -q compile

field | ./bench-top20.sh ${C} ${P} --set panel-shadow.txt --seeds 2 --seed-base 19300 --arms plans/pc-shadow.arms --out ${W} --label pc-shadow --shuffle-jobs
  after: prep
  watch: field=1217
  stop: fails 30
  stop: dead 8
  stop: skips 80 over 200
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: aa after 20%

gate | python3 ../data/tools/multiarm.py ${W}/arms.tsv --out ${OUT}/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)_pc-shadow.md && python3 tools/per_robot.py ${W}/arms.tsv --arms kp --out ${OUT}/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)_pc-shadow-per-robot.md --out-tsv ${OUT}/pc-shadow-per-robot.tsv
  after: field

pr | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-shadow-results "1v1 shadow fix (MOVE-43) on the whole field, 2 seeds" ${OUT}/*_pc-shadow*.md ${OUT}/pc-shadow-per-robot.tsv
  after: gate
